osi who are strong and swift-footed, worthy of being called elite fighters. When they are buried, the famiglia might send a letter of condolence home, nothing more.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt by a miniscule amount when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4400,"atk":375,"def":180,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8}},"elite_famiglia_caster":{"slug":"elite_famiglia_caster","name":"Elite Famiglia Caster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Famiglia Caster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A skilled Caster can often turn the tide of a battle. Though these claim to hold formidable positions, everyone knows they are nothing without the protection of their famiglia.","abilities":["Attacks two targets simultaneously.","Can stop attacking to continually increase Blood Debt"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":400,"def":250,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"siracusan_civilian":{"slug":"siracusan_civilian","name":"Siracusan Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Siracusan Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"These Siracusan civilians seem to have strayed into the fighting despite having been evacuated along with the rest of the crowd earlier. For whatever reason, whenever an accident of any sort happens, everyone's wrath falls upon you.","abilities":["Gradually reduces Blood Debt over time while on the battlefield; however, increases Blood Debt by a significant amount upon dying"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":0,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":null}},"fam